{
 "model": "unified v9: backbone unified_back9.onnx = MobileNetV3-Small (v6 trunk -> v8 -> rolled on 150-472 minus val/test/HOLD/HOLD9, end-to-end [features[10],[11]]: + the 365-472 live rounds (1 potion, v8 deploy, 奇术/追击/燃此魂 arms) with sweep-miss and own-action contact weighting), 192-d per frame; head unified_head9.onnx = 2-layer causal GRU (hidden 128) over 30 steps of [feat 192 | aux 15] (inputs unchanged from v6). Output 133 = the v6 77 (same offsets/labels, combo = v6 gap bins) + fut1f 46 (1..45 f + none, 1-frame next-contact distribution) + ours 6 + cont 2 + land 2. IMPORTANT: head9 requires back9; switch both together (comboV6:true). v9 = runs/v9c ep2 (sweep-miss/own-action weighted, sww 0.5 oww 0.25, sampling x2/x0.5); suggested trigTh 0.45",
